# config.aie — sterowanie Krysztalowej Krypty
WINDOW_WIDTH 1280
WINDOW_HEIGHT 720

BIND move_forward W
BIND move_backward S
BIND move_left A
BIND move_right D

BIND shoot MOUSE_LEFT
BIND jump SPACE
BIND crouch C
BIND sprint LEFT_SHIFT
BIND interact E

BIND restart ENTER
BIND fullscreen F11
BIND pause ESCAPE
